        "title": "Understand the Problem",
        "text": "When squares of side $x$ are cut from each corner:\n\n- Original length 24 cm loses $x$ from each end: new length = $24 - 2x$\n- Original width 16 cm loses $x$ from each end: new width = $16 - 2x$\n- The folded sides have height $x$",
